          "discovery": {
            "description": "Swap $0.10 of USDC on Base into sats on Bitcoin Lightning: pay this route over x402, name a Lightning address or a BOLT11 invoice for exactly the quoted sats (or with no amount), and the desk pays the sats within seconds with the preimage as the receipt. Testnet instance: Base Sepolia USDC in, Lightning testnet3 sats out.",
            "service_name": "kychange",
            "tags": [
